'''Johnnyleon''' (ジョン・レオン, ''Jon Reon'', '''John Leon''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy introduced in [[Uncanny Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

