==Trivia==
*Aside from being a play on "chameleon" (referring to his appearance as well as his presumed ability to manipulate his attributes through adaptation resulting in him having multiple traits), Johnnyleon's name and description reference [[wikipedia:John Lennon|John Lennon]], a famous singer and songwriter and co-founder of The Beatles. This is more apparent in his Japanese description, which claims he was an active band member but split from them due to a disagreement with "Beetle".
*Johnnyleon's traits, combined with his debut stage being [[Rainbow Bridge Toll]], may reference [[wikia:drstone:Chrome|Chrome]]'s "Rainbow Bridge" technique in ''[[wikipedia:Dr. Stone|Dr. Stone]]'', where he throws various minerals into a fire to produce flames of three different colors: amber, [[:Category:Alien Enemies|blue]], and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|purple]], in that order.
*He is tied with [[Daboo of the Dead]] for the highest health of all Zombie enemies.
*He is tied with [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] and [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] for the most types of any non-event enemy, with three. 
**Of these, Johnnyleon is unique, as he is the only one with three traits, as opposed to two traits and a unique type such as [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]]. 
*Johnnyleon and [[Bears Be Back]] are the only Zombie enemies not to revive.
**Despite their inability to revive, the [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] sound and graphic will play if they are defeated by a cat with that ability.

